th. We cannot cite external. Must use supplied evidence only. There's no mention of Mozart birth. So cannot answer? Could we use evidence that Mozart's \"The Marriage of Figaro\" performed? That's not about birthplace. No.\n\nThus we cannot verify composer born in that town with given evidence. So answer \"noanswer\". But maybe there is evidence elsewhere: The evidence includes \"The National Peace Jubilee\" etc. Not relevant. No Mozart.\n\nThus answer noanswer."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1681,"completion_tokens":509,"total_tokens":2190,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791994537,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}